              <div style={{fontSize:10.5,color:C.muted,marginTop:2}}>{selectedDrawerReplacement.office} ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…Â¡ÃƒÆ’Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â· {REG_ST[selectedDrawerReplacement.status]?.l||selectedDrawerReplacement.status}</div>
